    Visual Studio 2013 normally picks up the Windows 8.1 SDK automatically.
    If that SDK is missing or incomplete on this machine (MSBuild reports
    warning MSB8003 and the compiler cannot find GL/gl.h), fall back to the
    Windows 7.1A SDK that older Visual Studio installs leave behind.
    On a machine with a healthy Windows 8.1 SDK this block does nothing.
  -->
